2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:07,740
It's not fair! It's my money! I know, but it's what Brad wanted.
這不公平！這是我的錢！我知道，但這就是布拉德想要的。

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,740
Okay, which one is she? Uh, that's Brad's widow.
好吧，她是哪一位呢？呃，那是布拉德的遺孀。

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,200
And why is she so upset? Because she just found out she was cut out of the will.
為什麼她這麼難過？因為她剛發現自己被排除在遺囑之外。

5
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,380
Ugh, doesn't she know you can't define yourself in terms of money?
呃，她不知道你不能用金錢定義自己嗎？

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,900
That it's about values and morals and your ability to give and receive love?
這是關於價值觀和道德以及你給予和接受愛的能力嗎？

7
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:24,140
No.
不。

8
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,180
Oh, Drake.
哦，德雷克。

9
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:31,480
I'm sorry, Amber. It's just like Brad to have to have the last word.
對不起，安柏。就像布拉德必須有最後發言權一樣。

10
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,480
I'm sorry I'm late. What happened?
抱歉我來晚了。發生了什麼事？

11
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,980
We just want to see the end. I want you, Drake.
我們只想看到結局。我想要你，德雷克。

12
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,880
I know you do, but you and I can never be together that way.
我知道你會的，但你和我永遠不可能那樣在一起。

13
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:42,140
What?
什麼？

14
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:47,800
There's something I never told you, Amber. I'm actually your half-brother.
有件事我從未告訴過你，安柏。其實我是你同父異母的弟弟

15
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,400
So what happens next?
那麼接下來會發生什麼事呢？

16
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:58,200
Well, I get the medical award for separating the Siamese twins.
好吧，我因分離連體雙胞胎而獲得醫學獎。

17
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:03,020
Then Amber and I go to Venezuela to meet our other half-brother, Ramon.
然後我和安柏去委內瑞拉見我們的另一個同父異母的兄弟拉蒙。

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,300
And that's where I find the world's biggest emerald. It's really big, but it's cursed.
這就是我發現世界上最大的祖母綠的地方。確實很大，但是卻被詛咒了。

19
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,400
God, that is good TV.
天哪，這真是個好電視。

20
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:25,580
So no one told you life was gonna be this way
所以沒有人告訴你生活會是這樣

21
00:01:25,580 --> 00:01:30,540
Your job's a joke, you're broke, your love life's the old way
你的工作就是個笑話，你破產了，你的愛情生活還是老樣子

22
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:34,760
It's like you're always stuck in second gear
就像你總是卡在二檔

23
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:40,580
When it hasn't been your day or week or month or even your year
當這不是你的一天、一週、一個月甚至一年時

24
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:44,060
But I'll be there for you
但我會在你身邊

25
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:46,440
When the rain starts to pour
當雨開始傾盆而下時

26
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:49,080
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

27
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,220
Like I've been there before
就像我以前去過那裡一樣

28
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:54,580
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

29
00:01:54,580 --> 00:01:56,960
Cause you're there for me too
因為你也在我身邊

30
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,640
Come on, Pheebs. Play with me.
來吧，菲比。跟我一起玩吧。

31
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,480
No. This game is grotesque.
不，這個遊戲怪誕。

32
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:11,600
Twenty armless guys joined at the waist by a steel bar.
二十個沒有手臂的傢伙，腰間用一根鋼棒連在一起。

33
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:14,620
Forced to play soccer forever.
被迫永遠踢足球。

34
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:18,060
Hello, human rights violation.
你好，侵犯人權。

35
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,900
Pheebs, don't feel so bad for him.
菲比，別為他感到難過。

36
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:24,860
After the done playing, I break out the little plastic women and everybody has a pretty good time.
玩完後，我把塑膠小女人拿出來，每個人都玩得很開心。

37
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,560
Why don't you play with your roommate?
為什麼不和你的室友一起玩呢？

38
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:32,740
He's not a big fan of foosball.
他不太喜歡足球。

39
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,520
Are we not getting along with the new boy?
我們和新來的男孩相處不好嗎？

40
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:40,020
No, he's alright. He spends most of his time in his room.
不，他沒事。他大部分時間都在自己的房間裡度過。

41
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,820
Maybe that's because you haven't taken the time to get to know him.
也許那是因為你還沒花時間去了解他。

42
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:44,380
Let's remedy that, shall we?
我們來解決這個問題吧？

43
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,120
We don't need to remedy that.
我們不需要對此進行補救。

44
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,300
Oh, yeah. It'll be fun.
哦，是的。會很有趣的。

45
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:51,100
What was that?
那是什麼？

46
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:57,080
Hi. I just thought that it would be fun if the three of us had some beers and got to know each other.
你好。我只是想，如果我們三個喝點啤酒，互相認識一下，會很有趣。

47
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:58,560
Yeah, alright. That sounds alright.
是啊，好吧。聽起來不錯。

48
00:02:58,700 --> 00:02:59,560
Oh, good. Okay.
哦，很好。好的。

49
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:06,900
Oh, no. I have to go because I'm late for my green eggs and ham discussion group.
哦，不。我得走了，因為我參加綠雞蛋和火腿討論小組遲到了。

50
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:11,140
Tonight, it's why he would not eat them on a train.
今晚，這就是為什麼他不會在火車上吃它們。

51
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,960
Have fun. Bye.
玩得開心。再見。

52
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,100
That was so lame.
那太蹩腳了。

53
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,120
I know. Yeah.
我知道。是的。

54
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:18,440
Okay. Talk to him.
好的。和他談談。

55
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:26,680
So, you think that speed racer guy gets a lot of tickets?
那麼，你認為那個速度賽車手能得到很多票嗎？

56
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,780
That's good. That's good. So, who broke up with who?
那挺好的。那挺好的。那麼，誰和誰分手了呢？

57
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,380
What are you kidding? I broke up with her.
你開什麼玩笑？我和她分手了。

58
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:37,780
She actually thought that Sean Penn was the capital of Cambodia.
她其實以為西恩潘是柬埔寨的首都。

59
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:44,860
That's good, man. When everybody knows that the capital of Cambodia is...
那很好，夥計。當每個人都知道柬埔寨的首都是...

60
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:45,900
Well, it's not Sean Penn.
好吧，這不是西恩潘。

61
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:46,300
Not Sean Penn.
不是西恩潘。

62
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,160
Alright. I got a funny one.
好吧。我有一個有趣的。

63
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:52,280
Alright. My last girlfriend, Tilly, okay?
好吧。我最後一個女朋友蒂莉，好嗎？

64
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:54,180
We're eating breakfast, right? And I made all these pancakes.
我們正在吃早餐，對嗎？我做了所有這些煎餅。

65
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,620
There was like 50 pancakes, right?
大概有50個煎餅吧？

66
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,200
And all of a sudden, she turns to me, alright?
突然，她轉向我，好嗎？

67
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,020
And she says, Eddie. I say, yeah.
她說，埃迪。我說，是啊。

68
00:03:58,060 --> 00:04:00,380
She says, Eddie, I don't want to see you anymore.
她說，艾迪，我不想再見到你了。

69
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:05,420
And it was literally like she had reached into my chest, ripped out my heart,
就好像她把手伸進我的胸口，拿出了我的心，

70
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:08,120
and smeared it all over my life, you know?
並把它塗抹在我的一生中，你知道嗎？

71
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:10,820
It was like this incredible abyss, you know?
這就像一個令人難以置信的深淵，你知道嗎？

72
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,580
And I'm falling, and I keep falling, and I don't think I'm ever going to stop.
我正在墜落，而且一直在墜落，我想我永遠不會停止。

73
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:21,700
That wasn't such a funny story, was it?
這不是一個有趣的故事，對嗎？

74
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:32,380
And a crusty old man said, I'll do what I can, and the rest of the rats played maracas.
一位脾氣暴躁的老人說，我會盡力而為，其餘的老鼠就開始玩沙球。

75
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,580
That's it. Thanks. Goodbye.
就是這樣。謝謝。再見。

76
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,780
Phoebe's got another job, right?
菲比還有另一份工作，對嗎？

77
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,700
Right. That's an idea.
正確的。這是一個想法。

78
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:44,720
Yeah, Phoebe.
是的，菲比。

79
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:45,120
I know.
我知道。

80
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:48,060
Well, we should probably get going.
好吧，我們也許該出發了。

81
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:50,900
We should go, too. I've got patients at 8 in the morning.
我們也該走了。我早上八點就有病人。

82
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,980
You know, I was thinking, you know how we always stay at your apartment?
你知道，我在想，你知道我們怎麼總是住在你的公寓嗎？

83
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,200
Well, I thought maybe tonight we'd stay at my place.
好吧，我想也許今晚我們會留在我家。

84
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,340
I don't know. I don't have my jammies.
我不知道。我沒有睡衣。

85
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:01,980
Well, maybe you don't need them.
好吧，也許你不需要它們。

86
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,380
My baby sister, ladies and gentlemen.
我的小妹妹，女士們、先生們。

87
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,140
Shut up. I'm happy.
住口。我很高興。

88
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:11,860
Oh, this is so nice.
哦，這太好了。

89
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,080
Alright, I have to make a speech.
好吧，我得發表演說了。

90
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:18,040
I just want to say that of all the guys that Monica has been with, and that is a lot,
我只想說，在莫妮卡交往過的所有男人中，有很多，

91
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,280
I like you the best.
我最喜歡你了。

92
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:25,440
Oh, thank you, Phoebe. That's very sweet.
哦，謝謝你，菲比。非常甜蜜。

93
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:25,760
Okay.
好的。

94
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:29,220
I hear that. She likes me best.
我聽到了。她最喜歡我了。

95
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,720
And apparently it had been a lot.
顯然已經很多了。

96
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:36,040
Not a lot. Phoebe's kidding.
不是很多。菲比開玩笑的。

97
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,160
Phoebe's crazy.
菲比瘋了。

98
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:39,960
Phoebe's dead.
菲比死了。

99
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:47,060
Hi.
你好。

100
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:47,620
Hi.
你好。

101
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,500
I'm looking for Eddie Minowick.
我在找艾迪·米諾威克。

102
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,620
Oh, he's not here right now. I'm Chandler.
噢，他現在不在。我是錢德勒。

103
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:55,040
Can I take a message or a fish tank?
我可以留言或帶魚缸嗎？

104
00:05:55,740 --> 00:05:56,220
Thanks.
謝謝。

105
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,980
Oh, come on in.
哦，進來吧。

106
00:05:59,240 --> 00:05:59,900
I'm Tilly.
我是蒂莉。

107
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:05,960
Oh.
哦。

108
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:09,320
I gather by that oh that he told you about me.
我據此推測，哦，他告訴你關於我的事。

109
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:15,140
Well, yeah, your name came up in a conversation that terrified me to my very soul.
嗯，是的，在一次談話中你的名字出現了，這讓我感到非常害怕。

110
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,800
He's kind of intense, huh?
他有點激烈，對吧？

111
00:06:19,340 --> 00:06:19,740
Yes.
是的。

112
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:22,020
Hey, can I ask you, is Eddie a little...
嘿，我可以問你一下，Eddie 是不是有點…

113
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,600
A little what?
一點什麼？

114
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,800
A bit country?
有點鄉村？

115
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:30,660
Or, uh, you know, a little rock and roll?
或者，呃，你知道，一點搖滾樂？

116
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,040
Come on in here, you roomie.
進來吧，你的室友。

117
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:36,080
Hello, Tilly.
你好，蒂莉。

118
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:39,460
Eddie, I just came by to drop off your tank.
艾迪，我只是來送你的坦克。

119
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,080
That's very thoughtful of you.
你想得真周到。

120
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:42,740
It's very thoughtful.
這是非常周到的。

121
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:49,100
Well, okay then.
好吧，那好吧。

122
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,780
I'm gonna go.
我要走了。

123
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,160
Bye.
再見。

124
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,720
Bye-bye.
再見。

125
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,300
Bye.
再見。

126
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,720
So, we getting a fish?
那麼，我們要一條魚嗎？

127
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:59,540
You went sex with her, didn't you?
你和她發生了性關係，不是嗎？

128
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:03,420
Feet.
腳。

129
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,420
Check it out, check it out, check it out, check it out.
檢查一下，檢查一下，檢查一下，檢查一下。

130
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,480
Oh, oh, soap opera digest.
哦哦，肥皂剧摘要。

131
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:09,980
Oh, that's one of my favorite digests.
哦，這是我最喜歡的摘要之一。

132
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,760
Page 42, page 42, page 42.
第 42 頁，第 42 頁，第 42 頁。

133
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,240
Okay, okay, okay.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

134
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:15,640
Oh, hey.
哦，嘿。

135
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,880
New doc on the block, Days of Our Lives, Joey Tribbiani.
街區新醫生，《我們的日子》，喬伊·特里比亞尼。

136
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:20,900
Oh, cool picture.
哦，很酷的圖片。

137
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,520
Yeah.
是的。

138
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:22,100
Oh.
哦。

139
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,060
Oh, I look good.
哦，我看起來不錯。

140
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,700
Hey, is this true?
嘿，這是真的嗎？

141
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,900
That you write a lot of your own lines?
你自己寫了很多臺詞嗎？

142
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,960
Uh, well, kind of, yeah.
呃，嗯，有點，是的。

143
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:34,960
Like, remember last week when Alex was in the accident?
就像，還記得上週亞歷克斯遭遇事故時嗎？

144
00:07:35,380 --> 00:07:37,060
Well, the line in the script was,
嗯，劇本中的臺詞是，

145
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,240
if we don't get this woman to a hospital,
如果我們不把這名婦女送往醫院

146
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,560
she's going to die.
她快要死了。

147
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:42,020
But I made it.
但我做到了。

148
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,980
If this woman doesn't get to a hospital,
如果這個女人不去醫院

149
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,700
she's not gonna live.
她活不下去了。

150
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:46,540
Remember?
記住？

151
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,120
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

152
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:50,460
I see what you did there.
我明白你在那裡做了什麼。

153
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,840
Aren't you afraid, though,
不過你不害怕嗎

154
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,240
that the writers are gonna be kind of mad
編劇們會有點生氣

155
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,000
when they read this?
他們什麼時候讀到這篇？

156
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:58,480
Huh.
呵呵。

157
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:01,000
Never really thought about the writers.
從來沒有真正考慮過編劇。

158
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,600
The scripts just kind of come to my house.
劇本就這樣來到我家了。

159
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:07,640
But you know what?
但你知道嗎？

160
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:09,860
This makes me look good,
這讓我看起來很好，

161
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:11,820
which makes the show look good,
這使得節目看起來不錯，

162
