00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,000
I will, I will, I will.
我會，我會，我會。

350
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,060
Hey, I will clean the apartment for two months.
嘿，我會打掃公寓兩個月。

351
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,120
All right, I'll tell you what.
好吧，我告訴你什麼。

352
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:29,440
I'll give this to you now.
我現在就把這個給你。

353
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:29,600
Okay.
好的。

354
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:31,340
If you can tell me where we keep the dustpan.
如果你能告訴我我們把簸箕放在哪裡。

355
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:32,780
Okay.
好的。

356
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:34,720
Arrghh!
啊啊！

357
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:42,400
So were you in, ma'am?
那你在嗎，女士？

358
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:48,800
Okay. You know what?
好的。你知道嗎？

359
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:50,820
You know what? We are both adults here.
你知道嗎？在這裡我們都是成年人了。

360
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:53,380
Right? Well, there has got to be a mature way to handle this.
正確的？嗯，必須有一個成熟的方法來處理這個問題。

361
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:54,860
Rock, paper, scissors?
石頭、剪刀、布？

362
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:55,480
Got it.
知道了。

363
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:58,400
One, two, three.
一二三。

364
00:16:59,300 --> 00:16:59,660
Yes!
是的！

365
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:02,200
Fine.
美好的。

366
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,680
Go have sex.
去發生性關係吧。

367
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:05,680
No!
不！

368
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:09,240
You have got it completely wrong.
你完全錯了。

369
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:11,120
John Savage was deer hunter.
約翰·薩維奇是一名獵鹿人。

370
00:17:11,340 --> 00:17:12,080
No legs.
沒有腿。

371
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:13,560
John Voight was coming home.
約翰沃伊特要回家了。

372
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:14,720
Couldn't feel his legs.
感覺不到他的腿了。

373
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:15,300
No. No.
不，不。

374
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:16,180
No way.
決不。

375
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:18,420
You've got it totally the other way around, my friend.
你的想法完全相反，我的朋友。

376
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:19,520
Don Voight was...
唐沃伊特是...

377
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:20,020
Honey?
蜂蜜？

378
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:20,840
What?
什麼？

379
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,280
Shall we?
我們可以？

380
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:30,640
Shall we?
我們可以？

381
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:31,820
It's not going to happen.
這不會發生。

382
00:17:32,500 --> 00:17:33,580
They're doing it tonight.
他們今晚就這麼做。

383
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:34,920
We can do it tomorrow.
我們明天就可以做。

384
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:41,180
Uh, in the future, if I could see the schedule beforehand.
呃，以後如果能提前看到行程就好了。

385
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,180
So when I woke up this morning,
所以當我今天早上醒來時

386
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:50,240
he'd stolen all the insoles out of my shoes.
他偷走了我鞋上所有的鞋墊。

387
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,160
Why?
為什麼？

388
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:55,780
Because he thinks I slept with his ex-girlfriend and killed his fish.
因為他認為我和他的前女友睡了，還殺了他的魚。

389
00:17:56,620 --> 00:17:58,020
Why would you kill his fish?
為什麼要殺他的魚？

390
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:04,080
Because sometimes, Phoebe, after you sleep with someone,
因為有時，菲比，在你和某人睡過之後，

391
00:18:04,740 --> 00:18:06,180
you have to kill a fish.
你必須殺一條魚。

392
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,660
Chandler, honey, sorry.
錢德勒，親愛的，對不起。

393
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,780
Okay, can we watch Joey's show now, please?
好的，我們現在可以看喬伊的節目嗎？

394
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:15,100
Yeah.
是的。

395
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,440
He's not here yet.
他還沒來。

396
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:18,560
So? He's on the show. He knows what happens.
所以？他在節目中。他知道會發生什麼事。

397
00:18:20,080 --> 00:18:22,100
Oh, I'm fine about my problem now, by the way.
哦，順便說一句，我現在對我的問題已經很好了。

398
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:22,520
Oh, good.
哦，很好。

399
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:26,400
Amber.
琥珀色。

400
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:29,840
I want you to know that I'll always be there for you.
我想讓你知道我會永遠在你身邊。

401
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:32,520
As a friend and as your brother.
作為朋友和你的兄弟。

402
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,440
Oh, Drake.
哦，德雷克。

403
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:36,220
Another day, huh?
改天吧？

404
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:38,120
Where's the medical award?
醫學獎去哪了？

405
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:39,580
Yeah.
是的。

406
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:41,520
Some guys are just lucky, I guess.
我猜有些人只是幸運。

407
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:46,640
Dr. Remore, report to first floor emergency staff.
Remore 博士，向一樓急救人員報告。

408
00:18:47,420 --> 00:18:47,840
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

409
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,240
Well, then, uh...
那麼，呃...

410
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,060
I guess that's me.
我想那就是我。

411
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:56,800
Anyone else need to go on the elevator?
還有人需要搭電梯嗎？

412
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:58,760
Dr. Remore? Dr. Remore?
雷莫爾博士？雷莫爾博士？

413
00:18:59,160 --> 00:18:59,480
No, no.
不，不。

414
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,300
They only said you.
他們只說你。

415
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:05,400
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

416
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:06,980
All right.
好的。

417
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:08,200
I love you, Drake.
我愛你，德雷克。

418
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:09,440
Yeah, whatever.
是的，無論如何。

419
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:11,720
Oh, no!
哦，不！

420
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:13,860
Drake, look out!
德雷克，小心！

421
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:14,620
Drake!
德雷克！

422
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,440
Did they just kill off Joey?
他們剛剛殺了喬伊嗎？

423
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:20,080
No!
不！

424
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:23,880
Now, maybe.
現在，也許吧。

425
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:26,880
Come on!
快點！

426
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:27,160
Joey!
喬伊！

427
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:29,160
Open up! We want to talk to you!
開啟！我們想和你談談！

428
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:30,980
I don't feel like talking!
我不想說話！

429
00:19:31,300 --> 00:19:33,340
Oh, come on, Joey! We care about you!
哦，來吧，喬伊！我們關心你！

430
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:34,780
We're worried about you!
我們很擔心你！

431
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,640
And some of us really have to pee!
我們中的一些人確實需要撒尿！

432
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,340
Sorry, Joey.
對不起，喬伊。

433
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:42,940
Hey.
嘿。

434
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:47,460
Listen, I'm sorry about your death.
聽著，我對你的死感到抱歉。

435
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:48,600
That really sucks.
那真的很糟糕。

436
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,980
Yeah, we came over as soon as we saw.
是的，我們一看到就過來了。

437
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:52,980
How could you not tell us?
你怎麼能不告訴我們呢？

438
00:19:53,020 --> 00:19:53,760
I don't know.
我不知道。

439
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,520
I was kind of hoping no one would ever find out.
我有點希望沒有人會發現。

440
00:19:58,160 --> 00:20:00,480
Well, maybe they could find a way to bring you back.
好吧，也許他們能找到辦法把你帶回來。

441
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:01,640
Nah.
不。

442
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,840
They said that when they found my body,
他們說當他們發現我的屍體時

443
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:06,400
my brain was so smashed in that
我的腦袋被打碎了

444
00:20:06,980 --> 00:20:09,240
the only doctor who could have saved me was me.
唯一能救我的醫生就是我自己。

445
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,200
It's supposed to be some kind of irony or something.
這應該是某種諷刺什麼的。

446
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,360
Joey, you're going to be fine.
喬伊，你會沒事的。

447
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,740
You don't need that show.
你不需要那個節目。

448
00:20:19,740 --> 00:20:21,540
It was just a dumb soap opera.
這只是一部愚蠢的肥皂剧。

449
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:25,220
Phoebe, this was the greatest thing that ever happened to me.
菲比，這是我經歷過的最棒的事。

450
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:27,860
Yes, I was going to incorporate that.
是的，我打算將其納入其中。

451
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:30,600
Oh, good, here's Monica.
哦，很好，莫妮卡來了。

452
00:20:30,740 --> 00:20:32,000
She'll have something nice to say.
她會有好話要說。

453
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:36,460
Um, I straightened out your shower curtain
嗯，我拉直了你的浴簾

454
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:37,440
so you won't get mildew.
這樣你就不會發黴。

455
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,460
What? To me, that's nice.
什麼？對我來說，這很好。

456
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:44,280
It's going to be okay. You know that.
一切都會好起來的。你知道的。

457
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:46,060
No, I don't.
不，我不。

458
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:50,920
It's like, you know, you work your whole life for something
這就像，你知道，你為某事工作了一生

459
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,960
and you think that when you get it,
你認為當你得到它時

460
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:55,580
it's never going to be as good as you thought it would be.
它永遠不會像你想像的那麼好。

461
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,700
But this so was.
但事實確實如此。

462
00:20:58,100 --> 00:20:59,720
You know, it changed everything.
你知道，它改變了一切。

463
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:02,980
Like, the other day, I got this credit card application
就像，前幾天，我收到了這張信用卡申請表

464
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:05,600
and I was pre-approved.
我已經被預先批准了。

465
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:07,760
Huh?
啊？

466
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:10,700
I've never been pre-approved for anything in my life.
我一生中從未獲得任何事的預先批准。

467
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:12,840
I'm sorry, man.
對不起，夥計。

468
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:16,340
Yeah, Joey, honey, I don't know if this will mean anything to you,
是的，喬伊，親愛的，我不知道這對你來說是否意味著什麼，

469
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:20,520
but you'll always be pre-approved with us.
但您始終會得到我們的預先批准。

470
00:21:21,180 --> 00:21:22,700
No, that means nothing to me.
不，這對我來說毫無意義。

471
00:21:29,980 --> 00:21:31,740
Pecan Sandy, just made them.
山核桃桑迪，剛做的。

472
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:34,080
Yeah, all right.
是的，好吧。

473
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:37,440
What are these, raisins?
這些是什麼，葡萄乾？

474
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:39,840
Uh, sure, why not?
呃，當然，為什麼不呢？

475
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,360
Listen, Eddie, um,
聽著，艾迪，嗯，

476
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:52,220
I've been thinking about our current living situation,
我一直在思考我們現在的生活狀況，

477
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,540
and, uh, why are you smiling?
還有，呃，你為什麼笑？

478
00:21:55,220 --> 00:21:56,020
I got a little surprise.
我有點驚訝。

479
00:21:56,020 --> 00:21:58,120
Look, that's a new fishy.
瞧，這是一條新魚。

480
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:02,680
I named him Chandler, you know, after you.
我給他取名叫錢德勒，你知道，以你的名字命名。

481
00:22:12,180 --> 00:22:14,220
Well, that's not even a real fish.
好吧，那甚至不是一條真正的魚。

482
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:18,020
No, that's a goldfish cracker.
不，那是金魚餅乾。

483
00:22:20,740 --> 00:22:21,620
So what's your point, man?
那你的意思是什麼，老兄？

484
00:22:26,120 --> 00:22:30,860
Okay, goodnight, you big freak of nature.
好吧，晚安，你這個大自然的怪物。

485
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,860
Hey.
嘿。

486
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:55,020
Hey.
嘿。

487
00:22:55,330 --> 00:22:55,870
Hey.
嘿。

488
00:22:58,110 --> 00:22:59,270
Whew, brisk tonight.
哎喲，今晚好熱鬧。

489
00:22:59,470 --> 00:22:59,990
Oh, man.
哦，夥計。

490
00:23:01,730 --> 00:23:02,950
Let's never speak of this.
我們永遠不要談論這個。

491
00:23:03,050 --> 00:23:03,450
You got it.
你明白了。

